.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "2024" "libmyutils" "User Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.PP
.B int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B wordCount()
function reads through the file stream pointed to by
.IR file
and counts the total number of lines, words and characters.
Results are stored in the integers pointed to by
.IR lines ,
.IR words ,
and
.IR chars .
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success and -1 on failure.
